              "content": "<table><tr><td colspan=3>Explanation with Algebra and Visualisation</td><td>Examples</td></tr><tr><td>A number divisible by12 is a multiple of 12.</td><td>12m</td><td></td><td>12, 24, 36, 48,108, 132.</td></tr><tr><td>Factors of multiples of12 will include factorsof 12.</td><td>12m<eq>= 2 \\times 6 \\times m</eq><eq>= 3 \\times 4 \\times m</eq></td><td><img src=\"images/page_8_table_image_3_1.jpg\"/>A factor of 12 covers a row fully.Hence, it covers all multiples of 12fully.</td><td>Factors of 24: 1,2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12,24.</td></tr></table>"
